{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into creativity with the Aquatic Pack for <i>Color A Cube</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the vibrant world beneath the waves to life with this ocean-themed DLC. The <strong>Aquatic Pack</strong> adds <strong>10 beautifully designed, paintable 3D models</strong> inspired by marine life. Each model is crafted with unique voxel detail, ready for your artistic touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</strong><br>\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Crab</strong> \u2013 234 voxels<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Jellyfish</strong> \u2013 1,223 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc20 <strong>Lionfish</strong> \u2013 288 voxels<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Clownfish (&quot;Nemo&quot;)</strong> \u2013 462 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Octopus</strong> \u2013 1,074 voxels<br>\ud83e\uddaa <strong>Oyster</strong> \u2013 546 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc0e <strong>Seahorse</strong> \u2013 408 voxels<br>\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Shark</strong> \u2013 780 voxels<br>\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Stingray</strong> \u2013 366 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc22 <strong>Turtle</strong> \u2013 272 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're shading soft jellyfish tendrils or detailing the fierce lines of a shark, this pack offers a sea of creative possibilities.<br>Perfect for ocean lovers, voxel artists, and anyone looking to add a splash of the sea to their <i>Color A Cube</i> experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739430?t=1747726686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739430?t=1747726686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739430/9532f9a1d40dfcce1d691c1b94b2387788a690d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747726686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739430/9532f9a1d40dfcce1d691c1b94b2387788a690d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747726686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into creativity with the Aquatic Pack for <i>Color A Cube</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the vibrant world beneath the waves to life with this ocean-themed DLC. The <strong>Aquatic Pack</strong> adds <strong>10 beautifully designed, paintable 3D models</strong> inspired by marine life. Each model is crafted with unique voxel detail, ready for your artistic touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</strong><br>\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Crab</strong> \u2013 234 voxels<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Jellyfish</strong> \u2013 1,223 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc20 <strong>Lionfish</strong> \u2013 288 voxels<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Clownfish (&quot;Nemo&quot;)</strong> \u2013 462 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Octopus</strong> \u2013 1,074 voxels<br>\ud83e\uddaa <strong>Oyster</strong> \u2013 546 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc0e <strong>Seahorse</strong> \u2013 408 voxels<br>\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Shark</strong> \u2013 780 voxels<br>\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Stingray</strong> \u2013 366 voxels<br>\ud83d\udc22 <strong>Turtle</strong> \u2013 272 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're shading soft jellyfish tendrils or detailing the fierce lines of a shark, this pack offers a sea of creative possibilities.<br>Perfect for ocean lovers, voxel artists, and anyone looking to add a splash of the sea to their <i>Color A Cube</i> experience!</p>","developers":["AlterEyes"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3366710","name":"Color-A-Cube"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739430/493267f92fc7536ef832bd1f64cda28cfd48567c/header.jpg?t=1747726686","is_free":false,"lin